msgid "Maintenance control fault: a service bypass is transmitting pump impulses into the supports of TEST SUBJECT (TEST_CASE_01). Strikes coincide with pump starts; airflow is steady. Staff await an immediate broadcast instruction. Review the earlier research records to distinguish support, sound and airflow cues."
msgstr "Maintenance control fault: a service bypass is transmitting pump impulses into the supports of TEST SUBJECT (TEST_CASE_01). Strikes coincide with pump starts; airflow is steady. Staff await an immediate broadcast instruction. Review the earlier research records to distinguish support, sound and airflow cues."

