msgstr "[TEMP STORY CONTENT] Repeat audible route instructions. Leave the resetting projector and its interrupted strip active, with lighting and airflow unchanged."

#: resources/incidents/temp_midcase_incident_01.tres:35
msgid "[TEMP STORY CONTENT] Turn off task lighting to conceal the strip gaps. Leave the resetting projector active and airflow steady."
msgstr "[TEMP STORY CONTENT] Turn off task lighting to conceal the strip gaps. Leave the resetting projector active and airflow steady."

#: resources/incidents/temp_midcase_incident_01.tres:41
